#sortorder:2
#showas:难度 4 - 单人 AI
Not a complex scenario at all.  It's just you and the AI, and it's set to difficulty 4.  This is a good place to start if you've never played an RTS before. But bear in mind all the cool and clever tricks aren't remotely here for the AI yet.

This is on the "realistic" map type, with 80 planets.  Simple Ensemble AI type.  Basic as you get!  Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.